# audio.cpp commit to build the prebuilt binaries from.
#
# One commit sha (or leave empty/only-comments to track audio.cpp main).
# `plumbing/fetch_binary.sh --build` checks this out before building, so a
# prebuilt binary can be rebuilt reproducibly later.
#
# The 2026-09-22 T4/L4 prebuilts were built before this pin existed, so their
# commit is unknown (their GCS manifest.json records audio.cpp_commit=unknown
# and ggml eb8e21b). Fill this in the next time a build is verified, and the
# manifest written by `--publish` will record it.
